<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Monday at the $675,000 Legg Mason Tennis Classic (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>9-Ken Carlsen (Denmark) beat Cecil Mamit (U.S.) 7-6 6-3</p>
<p>12-Marzio Martelli (Italy) beat Ivan Ljubiciic (Croatia) 7-6 7-5</p>
<p>14-Vince Spadea (U.S.) beat Stephane Simian (France) 2-6 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>15-Neville Godwin (South Africa) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>16-Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) beat Max Mirnyi (Belarus) 7-6 7-6</p>
<p>Gianluca Pozzi (Italy) beat Geoff Grant (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Luis Herrera (Mexico) beat Jim Grabb (U.S.) 1-6 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Garard Solves (France) beat Tommy Ho (U.S.) 3-6 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Luke Smith ( Australia) beat Mahesh Bhupath (India) 7-6 7-6</p>
<p>Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) beat Oren Motevassel (Israel) 6-3 6-7 2-1 ( retired)</p>
<p>Michael Joyce (U.S.) beat Steve Bryan (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>David Nainkin (South Africa) beat Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) 6-3 0-6 7-5</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat Roberto Jabali (Brazil) 2-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Marcus Hilpert (Germany) beat Reed Cordish (U.S.) 2-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Andrej Merinov (Russia) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-7 7-6 6-4</p>
<p>Bryan Shelton (U.S.) beat Alex Kim (U.S.) 7-6 6-3</p>
<p>Davide Scala (Italy) beat Patrick McEnroe (U.S.) 6-1 4-6 7-5</p>
</text>
